WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:08.900
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.500
Open the task — this one has no date yet

3
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.300
Tap Edit

4
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.100
Pull the form up to its dates

5
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.700
Turn on Due date

6
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.500
Pick the day in the calendar — or tap here to type it

7
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.200
Type the day the way you'd say it

8
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.700
The date is read as you type

9
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:38.000
Return sets it

10
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.600
Due time, if the hour matters

11
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.200
Start date: the day you plan to begin

12
00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.700
Save

13
00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.200
It starts today, so it moves to the top of the list

14
00:00:51.200 --> 00:01:00.700
The task carries its day and time
